; DIMLINEAR (PT26, #713): the preview of the dimension follows the pointer
; while the location is asked; Esc there leaves nothing and no undo step;
; then one undo step named after the command, U and REDO.
; Values by hand from PT23 with ISO-25, as in
; dimlinear/punti-direzione-automatica.
DIMLINEAR
0,0
40,0
!move 20,15
!report
!esc
!report
DIMLINEAR
0,0
40,0
20,10
!report
U
!report
REDO
